WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.904
Open the Practice Lab.

2
00:00:02.024 --> 00:00:04.509
Choose Practice Lab from More resources.

3
00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:08.530
Open Chart practice to inspect a scenario before making a choice.

4
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.809
Pro practice features are shown here.

5
00:00:11.853 --> 00:00:13.072
Choose a response.

6
00:00:13.192 --> 00:00:16.478
Select one of the scenario responses and read the feedback.

7
00:00:16.598 --> 00:00:20.545
The purpose is to explain your reasoning, not guess a guaranteed outcome.

8
00:00:21.602 --> 00:00:22.578
Choose a challenge.

9
00:00:22.698 --> 00:00:25.995
Open Challenges and start a three-trade reflection challenge.

10
00:00:26.115 --> 00:00:30.933
Progress is based on completing and reviewing practice, not chasing a profit target.

